OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with sunny spells across
OL,6,FEngland and Wales, though a few
OL,7,Fshowers may reach the far southwest
OL,8,Flater. Cloudier in Scotland and
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland with outbreaks of
OL,10,Frain, heavy at times in the west.
OL,11,FWindy in the north.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain across Scotland and
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland will spread slowly
OL,15,Fsouth, perhaps reaching northern
OL,16,FEngland later. Elsewhere, mostly dry
OL,17,Fwith variable cloud and isolated
OL,18,Fsouthwest showers. A warm night for
OL,19,Fmany.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
