OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FRain in the north will drift
OL,6,Fsoutheastwards with some heavy spells.
OL,7,FElsewhere, sunny or clear spells and
OL,8,Fmostly dry, though isolated showers
OL,9,Fpossible in the southeast. Feeling hot
OL,10,Fonce again.
